PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,FThe widow of Pc Andrew Harper, who
OL,7,Fdied in the line of duty in 2019, has
OL,8,Fcriticised the Government for not
OL,9,Fexcluding her husband's killers from
OL,10,Fearly release.
OL,12,FIt comes as the Prime Minister said
OL,13,Frape, serious child sex offences and
OL,14,Fgrooming are to be excluded from
OL,15,Fupcoming cuts to prison sentences.
OL,17,FEarlier, Andy Burnham paused plans to
OL,18,Frelease prisoners early in September
OL,19,Fto ease overcrowding in jails. The
OL,20,Fscheme will now be delayed until
OL,21,FOctober.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,FMr Burnham said he "wanted to go even
OL,7,Ffurther", but that it is not possible
OL,8,Fwithout the prison system collapsing
OL,9,Fand putting the public "at much
OL,10,Fgreater risk".
OL,12,FHe assured the public that offenders
OL,13,Fwill face tighter community
OL,14,Fsupervision, including new GPS
OL,15,Fmonitoring for rapists to restrict
OL,16,Fmovements.
OL,18,FHowever, the Government is facing
OL,19,Fcriticism that two of Pc Andrew
OL,20,FHarper's killers are still eligible
OL,21,Ffor early release.
OL,26,@nD@TOUoD@HO]qD@XOUrD@MO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,FPc Harper was 28-years-old when he
OL,7,Fsustained fatal injuries while
OL,8,Fresponding to a quad bike theft in
OL,9,FSulhamstead, Berkshire, in August 2019.
OL,11,FHe died after getting caught in a
OL,12,Fstrap attached to the back of a car
OL,13,Fand dragged down a country road as
OL,14,Fthree teenage suspects fled the scene
OL,15,Fof the burglary.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,FJessie Cole and Albert Bowers, who
OL,7,Fwere passengers in the car and both 17
OL,8,Fyears old at the time, were handed 13
OL,9,Fyears in custody for manslaughter
OL,10,Fafter a trial at the Old Bailey in
OL,11,F2020.
OL,13,FBoth men might be eligible to be
OL,14,Freleased from prison halfway through
OL,15,Ftheir sentences, Downing Street has
OL,16,Fconfirmed.
OL,18,FThe driver of the vehicle who caused
OL,19,FPc Harper's death, Henry Long,
OL,20,Freceived a 16-year sentence, and will
OL,21,Fnot be eligible for the scheme.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,FIn a statement, Pc Harper's widow,
OL,7,FLissie Harper, said: "This is
OL,8,Fdisgusting. I am beyond appalled and
OL,9,Fbristling with anger to hear that
OL,10,FAndrew's killers are soon to be free
OL,11,Fto roam the streets.
OL,13,F"What abhorrent message does this
OL,14,Fsend? How dare ministers say the
OL,15,Fkilling of a police officer is not
OL,16,Fenough of a 'sickening crime' that
OL,17,Fdeserves the stiffest of punishments.
OL,26,@oD@VOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,F"The level of disrespect the
OL,7,FGovernment are showing to Andrew and
OL,8,Fother victims ` and to their loved
OL,9,Fones such as me ` is beyond contempt."
OL,11,FShe said releasing Andrew's killers
OL,12,Fearly would be "an affront to justice"
OL,13,Fand "an utter betrayal".
OL,15,FMeanwhile, Thames Valley Police Chief
OL,16,FConstable Jason Hogg said the decision
OL,17,Fnot to exclude them is "demoralising
OL,18,Ffor all police officers".
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@fO]tD@POUtD@fO]uD@EOUuD@WO]yD@
OL,26,AXOUzD@XO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,FHe said: "I am beyond disappointed the
OL,7,FGovernment is continuing to allow PC
OL,8,FAndrew Harper's killers to be released
OL,9,Fearly from prison despite the
OL,10,Foverwhelming recent public outcry.
OL,12,F"It is simple: if Andrew's killers
OL,13,Fwere convicted today, they would
OL,14,Freceive life sentences due to the law
OL,15,Fthat was created in his name. They
OL,16,Fwould not be eligible for early
OL,17,Frelease.
OL,26,@nD@JOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,F"This decision is demoralising for all
OL,7,Fpolice officers and our fellow
OL,8,Femergency service workers, not just in
OL,9,Fthe Thames Valley, that puts
OL,10,Fthemselves in harm's way to protect
OL,11,Fand serve their community.
OL,13,F"We stand with Andrew's family, the
OL,14,FPolice Federation, our Police and
OL,15,FCrime Commissioner in our dismay and
OL,16,Fwe will continue to lobby the
OL,17,FGovernment to make the right decision."
OL,26,@nD@AOUyD@gO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,FAnnouncing the changes, the Prime
OL,7,FMinister said: "Keeping the public
OL,8,Fsafe is my top priority. That's why I
OL,9,Fasked for an urgent review of the
OL,10,Fprisoner release scheme.
OL,12,F"I fully understand the anger, anxiety
OL,13,Fand distress that's been caused. I've
OL,14,Fheard that loud and clear.
OL,16,F"That's why we're making significant
OL,17,Fchanges: offenders who have been
OL,18,Fsentenced for rape, serious child sex
OL,19,Foffences and other grooming offences
OL,20,Fwill be excluded from the changes.
OL,26,@oD@POUtD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,F"I want to be honest ` I wanted to go
OL,7,Feven further as I know there will
OL,8,Fstill be concerns about other
OL,9,Foffenders having their sentence
OL,10,Fshortened.
OL,12,F"But it's not possible without the
OL,13,Fprison system reaching capacity and
OL,14,Fcollapsing, which would put public
OL,15,Fsafety at much greater risk.
OL,17,F"That's why we will also be
OL,18,Fintroducing much tougher community
OL,19,Fmeasures.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G10/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,F"There will be a presumption that all
OL,7,Foffenders are tagged, longer periods
OL,8,Fof supervision and tough new rules,
OL,9,Fincluding restriction zones for
OL,10,Foffenders."
OL,12,FUnder changes in the Sentencing Act,
OL,13,Fsome 6,000 offenders were set to be
OL,14,Flet out of prison in September after
OL,15,Fserving a third of their sentence `
OL,16,Frather than half ` in a bid to ease
OL,17,Fprison overcrowding.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@KO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G11/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,FPrisoners serving longer sentences of
OL,7,Ffour years or more would be eligible
OL,8,Ffor release at the halfway point of
OL,9,Ftheir term, rather than at two-thirds
OL,10,Fas had previously been the case.
OL,12,FThe changes were due to be phased in,
OL,13,Fbeginning with prisoners of less than
OL,14,F575 days.
OL,16,FThe Government has said that, after
OL,17,Flistening to victims' concerns,
OL,18,Frapists and child sexual offenders
OL,19,Fwill not be eligible for the
OL,20,Fsentencing changes.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G12/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,FThese will be added to the exclusions
OL,7,Falready in place for 18,000 offenders,
OL,8,Fincluding those who have been found by
OL,9,Fa court to be the most dangerous or
OL,10,Fanyone serving a life sentence.
OL,12,FThe Government has also announced a
OL,13,Fnew package of victim support, backed
OL,14,Fby #10 million, to provide better
OL,15,Ftrauma-informed contact.
OL,17,FA new national helpline will also be
OL,18,Festablished and efforts made to
OL,19,Fcontact all affected victims to offer
OL,20,Finformation and support.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G13/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38514
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,FMr Burnham added that the Government
OL,7,Fwill deliver "the fastest prison
OL,8,Fbuilding programme since the Victorian
OL,9,Fera", aiming to create 14,000 new
OL,10,Fprison places by 2031.
OL,12,FThe Prime Minister has also asked
OL,13,FJustice Secretary Alex Norris to look
OL,14,Fat how the UK can remove more foreign
OL,15,Foffenders and faster, review
OL,16,FImprisonment for Public Protection
OL,17,F(IPP) sentences and free up space in
OL,18,Fwomen's prisons.
OL,26,@oD@NOUqD@DO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G14/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38515
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,FMr Norris said: "The Prime Minister
OL,7,Fand I have reviewed these reforms,
OL,8,Flistened to the concerns and gone
OL,9,Ffurther to protect victims.
OL,11,F"These are decisions no minister would
OL,12,Fever want to take, but it is right
OL,13,Fthese sickening crimes are excluded
OL,14,Ffrom these reforms.
OL,16,F"Victims will also have access to
OL,17,Fbetter support and reassurance that
OL,18,Foffenders leaving prison face tougher
OL,19,Fsupervision and punishment."
OL,26,@nD@QOUsD@AOUxD@AOU{D@\O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G15/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38516
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,FWider releases under the Sentencing
OL,7,FAct have been delayed from September
OL,8,Fto October, giving probation staff
OL,9,Ftime to plan for releases and to
OL,10,Fensure victims can have a say in
OL,11,Frestrictions placed on offenders.
OL,13,FThe changes also introduce a new
OL,14,Fprogression model which will end
OL,15,Fautomatic release for badly behaved
OL,16,Foffenders.
OL,18,FThose who break the rules or are
OL,19,Fviolent behind bars face spending 100%
OL,20,Fof their sentence locked up.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G16/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38517
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,FShadow justice secretary Nick Timothy
OL,7,Fsaid: "Labour whipped their MPs to
OL,8,Fvote to let rapists, paedophiles, and
OL,9,Fgrooming gang perpetrators out of
OL,10,Fprison early.
OL,12,F"Now they admit the Conservative
OL,13,Fcampaign to stop this was right ` this
OL,14,Fis a victory for victims.
OL,26,@oD@GOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G17/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38518
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,F"But their U-turn doesn't go far
OL,7,Fenough. Some child sex offenders and
OL,8,Fkillers, like those responsible for
OL,9,Fthe death of Pc Harper, will still be
OL,10,Freleased early. And the trauma of
OL,11,Fvictims being told their abusers may
OL,12,Fbe released can't be undone.
OL,14,F"One of Andy Burnham's first acts as
OL,15,FPrime Minister will be to let
OL,16,Fthousands of criminals ` including
OL,17,Fkillers and paedophiles ` out early."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOUyD@eO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G18/22
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38519
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,FReform UK's home affairs spokesperson
OL,7,FZia Yusuf said: "This announcement
OL,8,Fwill still result in dangerous and
OL,9,Fviolent offenders being let loose on
OL,10,Four streets and it fails to bring
OL,11,Fjustice to the family of Pc Andrew
OL,12,FHarper, whose killers remain on track
OL,13,Ffor early release under this
OL,14,Fdisgusting policy."
