OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,FThe Victims' Commissioner for England
OL,7,Fand Wales, Claire Waxman, said that
OL,8,Fearly release plans have "been a
OL,9,Fsource of shock, distress and
OL,10,Funcertainty for victims" and that many
OL,11,Fhave been let down by "poor
OL,12,Fcommunication".
OL,14,FOn the new exclusions, she said:
OL,15,F"While this will be well received by
OL,16,Fsome victims, most will not fall
OL,17,Fwithin those categories, and
OL,18,Fexclusions alone cannot guarantee
OL,19,Fvictim or public safety.
OL,26,@pD@ZOUrD@XO]sD@WOUtD@NO]wD@AOU
