PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785863930
OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,F"Effective risk management, meaningful
OL,7,Flicence conditions, proper supervision
OL,8,Fand timely, trauma-informed
OL,9,Fcommunication and support remain
OL,10,Fcritical."
OL,12,FMs Waxman added that delaying
OL,13,Fimplementation to October was a
OL,14,F"necessary step", and that the extra
OL,15,Ftime must be used to "deliver the
OL,16,Fprotections needed to keep victims and
OL,17,Fthe public safe".
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@JO]vD@AOUvD@PO]wD@VOUyD@PO]
