OL,3,CLissie Harper 'appalled' that two of
OL,4,CPc Harper's killers could soon be freed
OL,6,FDomestic Abuse Commissioner Dame
OL,7,FNicole Jacobs said not excluding
OL,8,Fdomestic abusers is "wrong and puts
OL,9,Fvictims lives at risk".
OL,11,FShe said: "It is critical that no
OL,12,Fabuser is released in October unless I
OL,13,Fam confident that victims' safety is
OL,14,Fnot being compromised."
